21:42.580 --> 21:43.110
Luo Ning!

21:44.980 --> 21:45.510
Luo Ning!

21:46.740 --> 21:47.620
Luo Ning!

21:57.580 --> 21:58.220
Siapa?

22:18.500 --> 22:20.540
Dia telah membunuh begitu banyak pengintip kita.

22:20.540 --> 22:22.540
